WEBVTT

45:03.644 --> 45:05.813
I think he's starting to like me.

45:05.938 --> 45:08.524
(LAUGHING)

45:08.649 --> 45:11.986
- "Going below"?
- Aye.

45:12.111 --> 45:15.864
Into the tunnel and out the other side.

45:15.990 --> 45:18.575
He'll be north of the Wall
for a month or two.

45:20.828 --> 45:23.872
So... you're heading down
to King's Landing too.

45:23.998 --> 45:26.542
Aye, day after tomorrow.

45:26.667 --> 45:30.379
I get about half of my recruits
from their dungeons.
